# Contact form → email delivery (Web3Forms).
# Get a free access key at https://web3forms.com — enter your email, no
# account or dashboard required; the key arrives by email in ~30 seconds.
# Then copy this file to `.env.local` and paste the key below.
#
# Without this key the contact form still works: it falls back to opening
# the visitor's own mail client, pre-addressed to you.
VITE_WEB3FORMS_KEY=
